    <summary>Digital forensics and incident response for AI coding agents</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
AgentDFIR collects, preserves, reconstructs and investigates the activity of AI
coding agents (Claude Code, Claude Cowork, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Copilot
and others) on a machine: sealed, hash-chained evidence packages, a unified
timeline, deterministic detections mapped to MITRE ATLAS and ATT&CK, and a
local browser-based case explorer. Single static binary, no runtime
dependencies, never phones home.

This package downloads the signed release archive from the GitHub release and
verifies its SHA-256 before installing `agentdfir.exe`.
]]></description>
